{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43243","headline":"日暖万年枝 · 郭求","name":"日暖万年枝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旭日升溟海，芳枝散曙烟。\n温仁临树久，煦妪在条偏。\n阳德符君惠，嘉名表圣年。\n若承恩渥厚，常属栋梁贤。\n生植虽依地，光华只信天。\n不才堪仄陋，徒望向荣先。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭求","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43243.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43243","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}